98
00:04:53,450 --> 00:04:56,010
engineering and has
learned all the theory,

99
00:04:56,010 --> 00:04:58,858
and so it's a natural step to
want too go and do it yourself.

100
00:04:58,858 --> 00:04:59,400
That's great.

101
