can score higher than that.

585
00:27:25,440 --> 00:27:30,560
So we really encourage you
to take this exam right

586
00:27:30,560 --> 00:27:33,830
after the course.

587
00:27:33,830 --> 00:27:36,290
Phillip can actually
endorse your log book,

588
00:27:36,290 --> 00:27:38,810
